{"seq":4,"slug":"major-works","title":"冯·诺依曼·major-works","stage":"DONE","category":"john-von-neumann","categoryLabel":"冯·诺依曼","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/major-works","rating":{"composite":3.91,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4.67,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/18_john-von-neumann/4_major-works","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"主要著作\">主要著作</h1><p>本卷以&quot;著作为单位&quot;呈现冯·诺依曼一生最具影响力的几部代表作，逐部解剖<strong>文本本身</strong>——它的成书背景、数学/逻辑骨架、核心论证与历史争议。这是本卷与兄弟卷的分工边界：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>本卷（主要著作）</strong>：聚焦具体著作的文本与内容。EDVAC 报告写了什么、《博弈论与经济行为》的数学结构、《量子力学的数学基础》的工具、《计算机与人脑》的论证。</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a></strong>：聚焦贡献本身（架构、博弈论、数学全才），不限于某部著作。</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a></strong>：聚焦可迁移的思想（存储程序、策略推理、自复制）的概念深度。</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a></strong>：聚焦这些著作问世<strong>之后</strong>对各领域与时代的塑造。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>简言之：想读&quot;书里讲了什么&quot;看本卷；想读&quot;思想是什么&quot;看思想与方法卷；想读&quot;后来怎么样了&quot;看影响与遗产卷。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三章结构\">三章结构</h2><ol>\n<li><strong><a href=\"the-edvac-report/\">EDVAC 报告</a></strong> — <a href=\"the-edvac-report/the-first-draft\">《EDVAC报告初稿》</a>（文档本身、署名争议、五大部件）与 <a href=\"the-edvac-report/blueprint-of-the-computer\">计算机的蓝图</a>（它确立的范式与冯·诺依曼瓶颈）。</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"theory-of-games/\">博弈论</a></strong> — <a href=\"theory-of-games/the-foundational-text\">《博弈论与经济行为》</a>（极小极大、期望效用、合作博弈）与 <a href=\"theory-of-games/a-new-science\">一门新的科学</a>（学科诞生与扩散）。</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"other-major-works/\">其他重要著作</a></strong> — <a href=\"other-major-works/mathematical-foundations-of-quantum-mechanics\">《量子力学的数学基础》</a>（希尔伯特空间、密度矩阵、测量公设）与 <a href=\"other-major-works/the-computer-and-the-brain\">《计算机与人脑》</a>（数字/模拟、精度-可靠性权衡）。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>计算机方向</strong>：1.1 → 1.2 → 3.2（从 EDVAC 报告到蓝图，再到晚年对脑与机的思考）。</li>\n<li><strong>数学/经济方向</strong>：2.1 → 2.2 → 3.1（从博弈论著作到学科，再回看量子力学的数学奠基）。</li>\n<li><strong>通读时间线</strong>：3.1（1932）→ 2.1（1944）→ 1.1（1945）→ 3.2（1958），看一位全才如何在物理、经济、计算三大领域接连立下奠基文献。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><p>各篇尽量自足，但具备以下背景会读得更顺：线性代数（理解极小极大与希尔伯特空间）、计算机组成原理基础（理解 EDVAC 五部件）、对博弈论&quot;策略/收益&quot;概念的基本印象。涉及具体公式处均已给出直观解释，无需深厚数学功底亦可把握主旨。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-edvac-report","title":"EDVAC报告","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/major-works/the-edvac-report","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-first-draft","title":"《EDVAC报告初稿》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/major-works/the-edvac-report/the-first-draft"},{"seq":2,"slug":"blueprint-of-the-computer","title":"计算机的蓝图","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/major-works/the-edvac-report/blueprint-of-the-computer"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"theory-of-games","title":"《博弈论与经济行为》","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/major-works/theory-of-games","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-foundational-text","title":"《博弈论与经济行为》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/major-works/theory-of-games/the-foundational-text"},{"seq":2,"slug":"a-new-science","title":"一门新的科学","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/major-works/theory-of-games/a-new-science"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"other-major-works","title":"其他重要著作","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/major-works/other-major-works","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mathematical-foundations-of-quantum-mechanics","title":"《量子力学的数学基础》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/major-works/other-major-works/mathematical-foundations-of-quantum-mechanics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-computer-and-the-brain","title":"《计算机与人脑》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/major-works/other-major-works/the-computer-and-the-brain"}]}]}